{
  "source": "Prompts/trust-trap-v8.mp4",
  "duration": 146.6666875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.48,
      "text": "We know AI is amazing, fantastic, and well, you can insert your own superlative right"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.48,
      "end": 5.7,
      "text": "here."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.16,
      "end": 9.58,
      "text": "How much should you trust it when you're the one making a high-stakes decision?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 13.0,
      "text": "Take a universally stressful choice, like picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.66,
      "end": 16.72,
      "text": "Let's test this by asking the exact same question twice."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.5,
      "end": 22.14,
      "text": "Once at the dinner table, and once in a chat window, should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.82,
      "end": 27.72,
      "text": "On the left side, your mom says, Indiana, you seemed more comfortable there, and when"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.72,
      "end": 29.2,
      "text": "you get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.88,
      "end": 33.14,
      "text": "Being somewhere you'll ask for help matters more for you than another ranking."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.64,
      "end": 37.14,
      "text": "She actually knows you, and holds a personal stake in your future happiness."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.92,
      "end": 39.42,
      "text": "The chatbot responds, Michigan."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.12,
      "end": 42.88,
      "text": "It offers world-class academics in a vibrant campus community."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.34,
      "end": 44.7,
      "text": "It could be an excellent fit for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.16,
      "end": 47.74,
      "text": "The chatbot only knows what you typed into the prompt box."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.26,
      "end": 52.22,
      "text": "It has never seen how you act when you're stuck, overwhelmed, or struggling."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.7,
      "end": 54.52,
      "text": "It has no stake in which school you choose."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.96,
      "end": 55.86,
      "text": "Which one would you trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.5,
      "end": 61.74,
      "text": "The AI's response is confident, highly polished, and incredibly easy to like."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.4,
      "end": 65.84,
      "text": "But read it closely, and you realize it is completely generic."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.68,
      "end": 70.24,
      "text": "It could have been generated for almost any student anywhere in the country."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.86,
      "end": 75.74,
      "text": "Trustrap is giving a human-sounding answer the trust you would give someone who knows you."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.22,
      "end": 80.84,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down exactly why modern AI feels like a real person,"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.32,
      "end": 83.5,
      "text": "dividing the illusion into two main reasons."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.5,
      "end": 86.46,
      "text": "First, AI sounds like a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.18,
      "end": 90.96,
      "text": "The software uses generated pronouns like I think and I feel,"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.4,
      "end": 93.64,
      "text": "which tricks your brain into hearing a human voice."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.44,
      "end": 98.54,
      "text": "Those are strictly statistically generated words, not genuine thoughts or feelings."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.5,
      "end": 102.12,
      "text": "Second, your brain naturally looks for a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.72,
      "end": 104.54,
      "text": "When you receive a conversational response,"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 108.1,
      "text": "you automatically begin searching for a persona behind the text."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.7,
      "end": 111.2,
      "text": "AI is an excellent tool for gathering facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.2,
      "end": 113.16,
      "text": "organizing complex options,"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.6,
      "end": 117.26,
      "text": "and even challenging your initial assumptions based on the data you feed it."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.88,
      "end": 121.82,
      "text": "But processing data is completely different from shared human experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.68,
      "end": 127.64,
      "text": "A mentor understands your history and shares the burden of living with the outcome of your choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.46,
      "end": 131.06,
      "text": "So use the chatbots to do your research."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.68,
      "end": 133.16,
      "text": "Let them lay out the pros and cons."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.0,
      "end": 136.38,
      "text": "But before you finalize a major life choice,"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.96,
      "end": 139.2,
      "text": "talk it through with the people who actually know you."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.2,
      "end": 142.34,
      "text": "Sounding human doesn't make AI human."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.14,
      "end": 145.58,
      "text": "For important decisions, talk to people who know you."
    }
  ],
